<title>BOTSWANA: Engen Botswana yr shr surges, div up.</title>
<headline>Engen Botswana yr shr surges, div up.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended August 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million pula unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (thebe)		  420    vs     245</p>
<p>    Total div (thebe)	   20    vs	17</p>
<p>    Attrib income	     6.31    vs    5.56</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     8.46    vs    6.92</p>
<p>    Tax			   2.16    vs    1.36</p>
<p>    Turnover		  114.13    vs   82.01</p>
<p>Div payable: January 15 1997</p>
<p>On register: November 30 1996</p>
<p>Full name: Engen Botswana Limited (energy)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said sales volumes grew 27 percent over the year and its share of the bulk fuel market in Botswana increased by 3.6 percent.</p>
<p>The company said it would invigorate its campaign to increase its market share in the year ahead.</p>
<p>-- Gaborone newsroom +267 347-182</p>
</text>
